  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Emp 207.24 Pre-Hearing Disclosure of Witnesses and Exhibits. Pre-hearing disclosure of witnesses and exhibits shall be ordered when necessary for a full and fair presentation of the evidence at the hearing.\n\nSource. #7246, eff 4-30-00; ss by #9126, INTERIM, eff 4-20-08, EXPIRES: 10-17-08; ss by #9296, eff 10-17-08",
